message: "If you use this repository in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "Assessing the Adversarial Robustness of Multimodal Medical AI Systems: Implementation"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Akbarnia"
    given-names: "Elahe"
    email: "elahe.akbarnia.edu@gmail.com"

abstract: >
  This repository provides an implementation of a multimodal adversarial
  robustness framework for medical AI systems. The implementation includes
  SE-ResNet-154 chest X-ray classification, Bio_ClinicalBERT clinical text
  classification, multimodal fusion strategies, image-based adversarial attacks
  using FGSM and PGD, text adversarial attacks, and robustness evaluation.

